{"channelId":"UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","row":["Focus Physical Therapy",45200,"Welcome to Focus Physical Therapy, where we help active individuals move better, recover faster, and achieve their goals! Whether you’re an athlete, weekend warrior, or fitness enthusiast, we specialize in helping you overcome injuries, enhance performance, and build lasting resilience. From injury rehab and analysis to prehab and return-to-sport training, we provide innovative, evidence-based solutions to help you feel and perform your best.\n\n📣 Work With Us:\nRemote Coaching: Get customized recovery and performance plans from anywhere.\nIn-Person Care: Visit us in Bend, Oregon, for expert, one-on-one therapy.\n\n💡 What You’ll Learn Here:\nRehab and recovery tips to overcome injuries.\nRunning and cycling strategies to build strength and reduce injury risk.\nGoal-driven plans to enhance performance and prevent setbacks.\n\n➡️ Subscribe now and join a community committed to moving better, feeling stronger, and living pain-free! Your goals are within reach—let’s achieve them together.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:35.461Z","channelId":"UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"031de68f997859ffbdbd35f8d17515065017147c958901d1ec1a3d22b61b1708","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7274eb87fc231f4285105c34b4ad0f61c1436c3b76f0ad5043b9d2f20aae31cd"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:43:43.301Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":45200,"raw":"45.2K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD-guG6MYkRnC1CCAbDwXOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02: